			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Lama-
<br />

<br />
This is Arialana, posting under Lanturias' name sense my name is in error and currently "inactive" or so the board's say.....  <img src="images/smiles/new_let_it_all_out.gif" alt="new_let_it_all_out.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
My 54 druid is already on shawl 3 for this quest.  I have been meaning to start most of my girls doing this quest however the threat from verant of nerfing the MQ'ing of this quest has made me see that it's best that I up all of their tradeskills individually to do this...I do however have a tradeskiller at my disposal.  Also is anyone going to do the Xanthe's earring/ Earring of Solstice quest? I am very interested in this quest, a very nice reward for it, but again very intense tradeskills if you don't want to buy all the ingredients. Which I am too stubborn to do  <img src="images/smiles/icon_lol.gif" alt="icon_lol.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
I will post Llaianya's tradeskill numbers underneath the other post to keep with tradition. Just wanted to affirm there is interest and other's doing these quests.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_surprised.gif" alt="icon_surprised.gif" border="0" />  Llaianya's at the point of going to Eastern Wastes and scrounging some materials from there...snow bunny meat etc...Just gotta get my lazy butt to doing it <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
