				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">PM Qallain aand tell him you're having problems... it's been something of a chore to get folks on board with everything... 
<br />

<br />
And yes, on the Earring of Solstice thing, but don't you need grandmaster's of the various tradeskills to complete it? Not that that isn't out of the realm of possibility, just that it's a little down the road for me. I'd definitely like to see Ela sporting some of those tho <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
I've already got one manticore mane for Lama.. just wanted to see what kind of fight they were one day, whooo.. not doin that again solo, it cost me my LoH and it was still up in the air as to who was going to kill whom there... happened to loot it, didn't know what it was for, but kept it to find out.. and for once I'm glad I did.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_biggrin.gif" alt="icon_biggrin.gif" border="0" /> The whole idea of Sony ending mq'ing is one reason I want to get moving on this.. if we work it, we might be able to get under the wire for it, which means a lot less cost for all of us.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
